    "eng_dens01_0755": "参考范文：The Chinese skill I want to share is calligraphy. With only a brush, ink and paper, we can turn words into art. Every stroke shows the writer's patience and feeling. When my foreign friend saw me write the character \"福\", she tried it herself and loved it. Calligraphy carries thousands of years of history, and sharing it lets the world see the beauty of Chinese culture. I believe the more we share, the more confident we become. (要点：技艺介绍+体验事例+文化价值+自信收束)",
