    "eng_dens01_0758": "参考范文：The invention I dream of is a smart schoolbag. It can weigh itself and tell me which books I really need each day, so my shoulders won't hurt any more. It also has a small solar panel to charge my phone in an emergency. Many students carry too many books, and back pain is a common problem. If the smart schoolbag comes true, going to school will be easier and healthier. Small ideas can make a big difference. (要点：发明+问题+功能+意义)",
